id: healing-buddy
name: Healing Buddy
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
buddyEffect: activated
maneuverType: standard
actionCost: 1
buddyAction: heal
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Active, for an Action: you or an adjacent Ally regain 2d10(bT) Life Points.
text: >
  Healing Buddy: This useful assistant heals your wounds.
  –Buddy Effect Type: Active
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Effects: Target yourself or an adjacent Ally. That target regains 2d10(bT) Life Points.
  –Adventure Effect: Increase the amount of Life Points you gain through the Recovery Adventure
  Maneuver by 1/2 of your Buddy Attribute.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Use, on its row, once a Combat Round while it is Active: the one targeted - or the owner, with
# nobody targeted - regains 2d10 for each base Tier. Adjacent is the table's.
#
# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Its Adventure Effect: the Recovery Adventuring Maneuver is not in this system.
